findings.description:
Nothing under `spec/` references `FallbackLocaleList`, `I18n.ensure_loaded!` or fallback resolution. The existing locale tests in `spec/controllers/application_controller_spec.rb` (around lines 92-101) only cover locale selection. Missing cases:

- the user → site → `:en` ordering, including de-duplication;
- `ensure_loaded!` actually loading an unloaded locale;
- `set_locale` loading the fallback chain;
- a key missing in the user locale resolving from the site locale and then English.

The change also turns fallbacks on in development and test, where they were previously production/profile only, so existing specs now run under different lookup semantics with nothing pinning it.
